WEBVTT

00:03:57.130 --> 00:04:00.630
because when you sketch out a
great businessman on paper,

00:04:00.963 --> 00:04:04.963
you might fall victim to the
myth of the perfect idea.

00:04:05.230 --> 00:04:08.930
Like Steve Blank, the father of modern
entrepreneurship education,

00:04:08.930 --> 00:04:13.563
likes to say there's a fine line between
vision and hallucination.

00:04:14.130 --> 00:04:16.730
So your task as an entrepreneur is, yes,

00:04:16.730 --> 00:04:20.263
to sketch out your idea on
a business model canvas

00:04:20.263 --> 00:04:24.030
and ask yourself how you're going
to go towards building this into

00:04:24.030 --> 00:04:29.397
a real business. But what you really need
to do is accept if your idea is truly

00:04:29.397 --> 00:04:30.697
innovative and disruptive,